          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Diseño visual ONLY · Demo Barbería Norte (+ skin Consultorio) · Elderly-UX · 390px · primary #F97316 · Cero código app.",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "KzBeT",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "DECISIONES ABIERTAS (defaults visuales)",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "C072M",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• [DECISIÓN § días] Default = Variante A lista próximos 7–14 días. Alt = B próximo libre + ver más.",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ilvwD",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• [DECISIÓN § duración] Slot size = duración del servicio (fija por servicio).",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UzvXr",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• [DECISIÓN § overlap] v1 = un solo calendario/recurso global (sin multi-sillón).",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Oi2P7",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• [DECISIÓN § efectivo] Reserva recibida · pago en el local; negocio confirma asistencia.",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "spQOx",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• [DECISIÓN § seña] v1 = 100% del precio. Seña parcial = future.",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ZPZNa",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• [DECISIÓN § WA] Toast “el negocio va a ser notificado” — sin UI de chat.",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "hDDcb",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
